  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A parallel plate capacitor has a dielectric slab of dielectric constant K between its plates that covers 1/3 of the area of its plates, as shown in the figure. The total capacitance of the capacitor is C while that of the portion with dielectric in between is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> . When the capacitor is charged, the plate area covered by the dielectric gets charge <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and the rest of the area gets charge <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> . The electric field in the dielectric is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and that in the other portion is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> . Choose the correct option/options, ignoring edge effects.<br ><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image2-95418e85-0042-4c6f-8564-a2a5d886ae5b.png\"/></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ryhh1",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GvoPE",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bD3pB",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vg5l1",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
